{"tuid":"enx2agv9s4y27moq","pageVersion":10,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2026-03-29"},"identification":{"ifids":["4C53696E-0662-4023-9059-87215BF84E11"]},"bibliographic":{"title":"A winter morning on the beach","author":"Roberto Ceccarelli (as E. Cuchel)","language":"en","firstpublished":"2025-09-01","genre":"Experimental","description":"It could be a lucky day \n<p> \nIt&#039;s a sunny winter morning and you&#039;re walking along the beach. \n<p> \nA few months ago, after your check-up, your doctor told you: «We need to keep your blood pressure under control. I&#039;m prescribing a medication for you to take every morning, but I also recommend exercising and taking a nice walk every day if you can. Start gradually and try to build up to about ten thousand steps a day, but don&#039;t overdo it.» \n<p> \nYou are fortunate to live in a coastal city. The beach, especially out of season, is an excellent place to enjoy a free and easy walk and breathe in the fresh air."},"contacts":{"url":"https://strawberryfield.altervista.org/winter-beach/index.php?lang=en"},"ifdb":{"tuid":"enx2agv9s4y27moq","pageversion":10,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=enx2agv9s4y27moq","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=enx2agv9s4y27moq&version=10"},"playTimeInMinutes":10,"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://unbox.ifarchive.org/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fcompetition2025%2FGames%2FA_winter_morning_on_the_beach.zip&open=play.html","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competition2025/Games/A_winter_morning_on_the_beach.zip","playOnlineUrl":"https://unbox.ifarchive.org/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fcompetition2025%2FGames%2FA_winter_morning_on_the_beach.zip&open=play.html","title":"A_winter_morning_on_the_beach.zip","isGame":true,"format":"hypertextgame","compression":"zip","compressedPrimary":"play.html"}